 # Changelog
 
 ## 1.0.0
-- Built the Northstar Websites theme with responsive templates, header panels, forms, newsletter management, local assets, and compiled production bundles.
-
+- Built the Atlasframe Digital theme with redesigned header panels, mobile drawer, fifteen-section homepage, services, work, blog, forms, newsletter management, local stock-photo usage, documentation, and compiled production bundles.
diff --git a/wp-content/themes/007_nolan_young_theme_atlasframe_digital/README.md b/wp-content/themes/007_nolan_young_theme_atlasframe_digital/README.md
index f66f3418336e47b1b4cf46a2947a2c152d4dda05..873336b993a62f62abdf26193b177b33cdb9f28c
--- a/wp-content/themes/007_nolan_young_theme_atlasframe_digital/README.md
