-
+`icon1.svg` and `platform-mark.svg` are original local Atlasframe Digital interface marks. They may be used for the header, mobile drawer, footer, small UI marks, and lightweight diagrams. Store only sanitized SVG interface icons in this folder and reference them through WordPress theme-path functions. Do not add third-party logo marks, remote icon packs, or SVGs pretending to be stock photography.
